WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:09.817
Every shift belongs to a venue. This tutorial shows how to add one, using fictional

2
00:00:09.817 --> 00:00:11.433
demonstration data.

3
00:00:11.893 --> 00:00:15.117
On Venues, select New venue.

4
00:00:15.569 --> 00:00:19.603
Enter the venue name, the client and the venue type.

5
00:00:22.104 --> 00:00:24.068
Add the address.

6
00:00:27.838 --> 00:00:34.391
Set the location and the geofence radius. Staff must be inside this area to clock in

7
00:00:34.391 --> 00:00:36.731
when the geofence is enforced.

8
00:00:37.186 --> 00:00:40.035
Set the default break in minutes.

9
00:00:40.498 --> 00:00:46.697
Select Create venue. The drawer stays open so you can add pay rates.

10
00:00:47.154 --> 00:00:52.643
Add an hourly rate for a role at this venue, then select Save changes.

11
00:00:53.124 --> 00:00:55.853
The new venue appears in the list.
